naval-treaty	sentence_5	lexical	\N	\N	4	{"text": "The first of these, however, deals with interest of such importance and implicates so many of the first families in the kingdom that for many years it will be impossible to make it public.", "section": "naval-treaty-section_1", "entities": []}
naval-treaty	sentence_6	lexical	\N	\N	5	{"text": "No case, however, in which Holmes was engaged has ever illustrated the value of his analytical methods so clearly or has impressed those who were associated with him so deeply.", "section": "naval-treaty-section_1", "entities": []}
