a-study-in-scarlet	sentence_128	lexical	\N	\N	127	{"text": "It was familiar ground to me, and I needed no guiding as we ascended the bleak stone staircase and made our way down the long corridor with its vista of whitewashed wall and dun-coloured doors.", "section": "section_7", "entities": []}
