a-study-in-scarlet	sentence_241	lexical	\N	\N	240	{"text": "So desirable in every way were the apartments, and so moderate did the terms seem when divided between us, that the bargain was concluded upon the spot, and we at once entered into possession.", "section": "section_10", "entities": []}
a-study-in-scarlet	sentence_242	lexical	\N	\N	241	{"text": "That very evening I moved my things round from the hotel, and on the following morning Sherlock Holmes followed me with several boxes and portmanteaus.", "section": "section_10", "entities": []}
a-study-in-scarlet	sentence_243	lexical	\N	\N	242	{"text": "For a day or two we were busily employed in unpacking and laying out our property to the best advantage.", "section": "section_10", "entities": []}
a-study-in-scarlet	sentence_244	lexical	\N	\N	243	{"text": "That done, we gradually began to settle down and to accommodate ourselves to our new surroundings.", "section": "section_10", "entities": []}
