a-study-in-scarlet	event_61_4	event	\N	Jefferson Hope seizes his companions and drags them into the shadow	60	{"section": "section_61", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2211"], "communicatesContent": null}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_61_5	event	\N	Jefferson Hope and his friends crouch down and hear owl calls nearby	60	{"section": "section_61", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2213"], "communicatesContent": null}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_61_6	event	\N	Two figures emerge from the gap and exchange a signal conversation	60	{"section": "section_61", "speakerId": "unknown_man_1", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2214", "sentence_2215", "sentence_2216", "sentence_2217", "sentence_2218", "sentence_2219", "sentence_2220", "sentence_2221", "sentence_2222", "sentence_2223"], "communicatesContent": "To-morrow at midnight. When the Whip-poor-Will calls three times. Shall I tell Brother Drebber? Pass it on to him, and from him to the others. Nine to seven! Seven to five!"}
