a-study-in-scarlet	event_71_9	event	\N	The young man holds Drebber by the collar, shoves him, and kicks him so that he is sent across the road.	70	{"section": "section_71", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2556"], "communicatesContent": null}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_63_8	event	\N	Jefferson Hope refuses to let Lucy Ferrier and John Ferrier rest longer	62	{"section": "section_63", "speakerId": "jefferson_hope", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2270"], "communicatesContent": "They will be upon our track by this time. Everything depends upon our speed. Once safe in Carson we may rest for the remainder of our lives."}
