a-study-in-scarlet	event_77_5	event	\N	Holmes comes into possession of the pills	76	{"section": "section_77", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2768"], "communicatesContent": null}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_77_6	event	\N	Watson praises Holmes and offers to publish an account of the case	76	{"section": "section_77", "speakerId": "john_watson", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2770", "sentence_2771", "sentence_2772", "sentence_2773", "sentence_2774"], "communicatesContent": "Your merits should be publicly recognized. You should publish an account of the case. If you won't, I will for you."}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_77_7	event	\N	Holmes hands Watson an Echo newspaper	76	{"section": "section_77", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2776", "sentence_2777", "sentence_2778"], "communicatesContent": null}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_77_8	event	\N	The Echo publishes a report about Hope and the murders of Drebber and Stangerson	76	{"section": "section_77", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2779", "sentence_2780", "sentence_2781", "sentence_2782", "sentence_2783", "sentence_2784", "sentence_2785", "sentence_2786"], "communicatesContent": null}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_78_1	event	\N	Sherlock Holmes laughs and remarks that the result of their Study in Scarlet is to get a testimonial.	77	{"section": "section_78", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2788", "sentence_2789"], "communicatesContent": "That's the result of all our Study in Scarlet: to get them a testimonial!"}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_78_2	event	\N	John Watson replies that he has all the facts in his journal and that the public shall know them.	77	{"section": "section_78", "speakerId": "john_watson", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2790"], "communicatesContent": "Never mind, I have all the facts in my journal, and the public shall know them."}
a-study-in-scarlet	event_78_3	event	\N	John Watson tells Holmes to be contented by the consciousness of success like the Roman miser.	77	{"section": "section_78", "speakerId": "john_watson", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2790", "sentence_2791", "sentence_2792"], "communicatesContent": "In the meantime you must make yourself contented by the consciousness of success, like the Roman miser—"}
