sign-of-the-four	event_59_7	event	\N	Abel White’s bungalow catches fire and flames burst through the roof	58	{"section": "section_59", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2496", "sentence_2498"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_59_8	event	\N	The narrator flees across the paddy-fields to Agra	58	{"section": "section_59", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2499"], "communicatesContent": null}
