sign-of-the-four	event_59_10	event	\N	English bands hold only the ground their guns command	58	{"section": "section_59", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2502"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_59_11	event	\N	The English fight against their own trained troops	58	{"section": "section_59", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2504"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_59_12	event	\N	A volunteer corps of clerks and merchants is formed at Agra	58	{"section": "section_59", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2505", "sentence_2506"], "communicatesContent": null}
