sign-of-the-four	event_60_7	event	\N	The narrator stands outside the gateway and looks down on the river and city lights	59	{"section": "section_60", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2534"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_60_8	event	\N	Drums, tomtoms, yells, and howls are heard all night from the rebels across the stream	59	{"section": "section_60", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2535"], "communicatesContent": null}
