sign-of-the-four	event_65_9	event	\N	The group makes a list of the gems	64	{"section": "section_65", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2694", "sentence_2695", "sentence_2696", "sentence_2697", "sentence_2698"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_65_10	event	\N	The group notes that some pearls were removed from the chest earlier	64	{"section": "section_65", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2699"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_65_11	event	\N	The group puts the treasures back into the chest and carries it to the gateway	64	{"section": "section_65", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2700"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_65_12	event	\N	The group renews its oath and agrees to hide and later divide the loot	64	{"section": "section_65", "speakerId": "dost_akbar", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2701", "sentence_2702", "sentence_2703"], "communicatesContent": "We agreed to conceal our loot in a safe place until the country should be at peace again, and then to divide it equally among ourselves."}
sign-of-the-four	event_65_13	event	\N	The group hides the treasure in the hall wall	64	{"section": "section_65", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2704", "sentence_2705"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_65_14	event	\N	The group makes careful note of the hiding place and draws plans	64	{"section": "section_65", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2705", "sentence_2706"], "communicatesContent": null}
sign-of-the-four	event_65_15	event	\N	The narrator recounts the mutiny's progress after Delhi and Lucknow are taken	64	{"section": "section_65", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2707", "sentence_2708", "sentence_2709", "sentence_2710", "sentence_2711"], "communicatesContent": null}
