sign-of-the-four	event_71_17	event	\N	The narrator takes the treasure-box, lowers it down, and slides down himself after leaving the sign of the four on the table	70	{"section": "section_71", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_2914"], "communicatesContent": null}
