yellow-face	event_5_2	event	\N	Watson introduces himself as a neighbour and offers help	4	{"section": "yellow-face-section_5", "speakerId": "watson", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_179", "sentence_180"], "communicatesContent": "I am your neighbour over yonder. I see that you have only just moved in, so I thought that if I could be of any help to you in any—"}
