yellow-face	event_8_4	event	\N	Jack's wife apologises for breaking her promise and says he would forgive her if he knew all the circumstances	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack_wife", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_298"], "communicatesContent": "I am sorry that I broke my promise, Jack; but if you knew all the circumstances I am sure that you would forgive me."}
yellow-face	event_8_5	event	\N	Jack asks his wife to tell him everything	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_299"], "communicatesContent": "Tell me everything, then."}
yellow-face	event_8_6	event	\N	Jack's wife says that she cannot tell him everything	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack_wife", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_300"], "communicatesContent": "I cannot, Jack, I cannot."}
yellow-face	event_8_7	event	\N	Jack says there can be no confidence between them until she identifies who has been living in the cottage and who received the photograph	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_301"], "communicatesContent": "Until you tell me who it is that has been living in that cottage, and who it is to whom you have given that photograph, there can never be any confidence between us."}
yellow-face	event_8_8	event	\N	Jack breaks away from his wife and leaves the house	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_301"], "communicatesContent": null}
yellow-face	event_8_9	event	\N	Jack tells Holmes that he has not seen his wife since yesterday and knows no more about the matter	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_302"], "communicatesContent": "That was yesterday, Mr. Holmes, and I have not seen her since, nor do I know anything more about this strange business."}
yellow-face	event_8_10	event	\N	Jack says that the matter has shaken him and that he does not know what to do	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_303", "sentence_304", "sentence_305", "sentence_306"], "communicatesContent": "It is the first shadow that has come between us, and it has so shaken me that I do not know what I should do for the best. Suddenly this morning it occurred to me that you were the man to advise me, so I have hurried to you now, and I place myself unreservedly in your hands. If there is any point which I have not made clear, pray question me about it. But, above all, tell me quickly what I am to do, for this misery is more than I can bear."}
