yellow-face	event_8_14	event	\N	Jack says he cannot be sure because he was too far away	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_310"], "communicatesContent": "Each time that I saw it I was some distance away from it, so that it is impossible for me to say."}
yellow-face	event_8_15	event	\N	Holmes comments that Jack appears to have been impressed by the face	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_311"], "communicatesContent": "You appear, however, to have been disagreeably impressed by it."}
yellow-face	event_8_16	event	\N	Jack describes the face as unnaturally coloured and rigid and says it vanished when he approached	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_312", "sentence_313"], "communicatesContent": "It seemed to be of an unnatural colour, and to have a strange rigidity about the features. When I approached, it vanished with a jerk."}
yellow-face	event_8_17	event	\N	Holmes asks how long it has been since Jack's wife asked for a hundred pounds	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_314"], "communicatesContent": "How long is it since your wife asked you for a hundred pounds?"}
yellow-face	event_8_18	event	\N	Jack answers that it was nearly two months ago	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_315"], "communicatesContent": "Nearly two months."}
yellow-face	event_8_19	event	\N	Holmes asks whether Jack has ever seen a photograph of Jack's wife's first husband	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_316"], "communicatesContent": "Have you ever seen a photograph of her first husband?"}
yellow-face	event_8_20	event	\N	Jack says he has not seen a photograph because papers were destroyed in the Atlanta fire	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_317"], "communicatesContent": "No; there was a great fire at Atlanta very shortly after his death, and all her papers were destroyed."}
yellow-face	event_8_21	event	\N	Holmes states that Jack says she had a certificate of death	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_318", "sentence_319"], "communicatesContent": "And yet she had a certificate of death. You say that you saw it."}
