yellow-face	event_8_22	event	\N	Jack says she got a duplicate after the fire	7	{"section": "yellow-face-section_8", "speakerId": "jack", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_320"], "communicatesContent": "Yes; she got a duplicate after the fire."}
