stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_1	lexical	\N	\N	0	{"text": "IV.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_2	lexical	\N	\N	1	{"text": "The Stockbroker's Clerk", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_3	lexical	\N	\N	2	{"text": "Shortly after my marriage I had bought a connection in the Paddington district.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_4	lexical	\N	\N	3	{"text": "Old Mr. Farquhar, from whom I purchased it, had at one time an excellent general practice; but his age, and an affliction of the nature of St. Vitus's dance from which he suffered, had very much thinned it.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_5	lexical	\N	\N	4	{"text": "The public not unnaturally goes on the principle that he who would heal others must himself be whole, and looks askance at the curative powers of the man whose own case is beyond the reach of his drugs.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_6	lexical	\N	\N	5	{"text": "Thus as my predecessor weakened his practice declined, until when I purchased it from him it had sunk from twelve hundred to little more than three hundred a year.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_7	lexical	\N	\N	6	{"text": "I had confidence, however, in my own youth and energy, and was convinced that in a very few years the concern would be as flourishing as ever.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_8	lexical	\N	\N	7	{"text": "For three months after taking over the practice I was kept very closely at work, and saw little of my friend Sherlock Holmes, for I was too busy to visit Baker Street, and he seldom went anywhere himself save upon professional business.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_9	lexical	\N	\N	8	{"text": "I was surprised, therefore, when, one morning in June, as I sat reading the _British Medical Journal_ after breakfast, I heard a ring at the bell, followed by the high, somewhat strident tones of my old companion's voice.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_10	lexical	\N	\N	9	{"text": "\\"Ah, my dear Watson,\\" said he, striding into the room, \\"I am very delighted to see you!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_12	lexical	\N	\N	11	{"text": "\\"Thank you, we are both very well,\\" said I, shaking him warmly by the hand.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_13	lexical	\N	\N	12	{"text": "\\"And I hope, also,\\" he continued, sitting down in the rocking-chair, \\"that the cares of medical practice have not entirely obliterated the interest which you used to take in our little deductive problems.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_14	lexical	\N	\N	13	{"text": "\\"On the contrary,\\" I answered, \\"it was only last night that I was looking over my old notes, and classifying some of our past results.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_15	lexical	\N	\N	14	{"text": "\\"I trust that you don't consider your collection closed.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_16	lexical	\N	\N	15	{"text": "\\"Not at all.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_17	lexical	\N	\N	16	{"text": "I should wish nothing better than to have some more of such experiences.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_18	lexical	\N	\N	17	{"text": "\\"To-day, for example?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_19	lexical	\N	\N	18	{"text": "\\"Yes, to-day, if you like.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_20	lexical	\N	\N	19	{"text": "\\"And as far off as Birmingham?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_21	lexical	\N	\N	20	{"text": "\\"Certainly, if you wish it.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_22	lexical	\N	\N	21	{"text": "\\"And the practice?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_23	lexical	\N	\N	22	{"text": "\\"I do my neighbour's when he goes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_24	lexical	\N	\N	23	{"text": "He is always ready to work off the debt.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_25	lexical	\N	\N	24	{"text": "\\"Ha!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_26	lexical	\N	\N	25	{"text": "Nothing could be better,\\" said Holmes, leaning back in his chair and looking keenly at me from under his half closed lids.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_27	lexical	\N	\N	26	{"text": "\\"I perceive that you have been unwell lately.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_28	lexical	\N	\N	27	{"text": "Summer colds are always a little trying.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_29	lexical	\N	\N	28	{"text": "\\"I was confined to the house by a severe chill for three days last week.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_30	lexical	\N	\N	29	{"text": "I thought, however, that I had cast off every trace of it.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_31	lexical	\N	\N	30	{"text": "\\"So you have.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_32	lexical	\N	\N	31	{"text": "You look remarkably robust.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_33	lexical	\N	\N	32	{"text": "\\"How, then, did you know of it?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_34	lexical	\N	\N	33	{"text": "\\"My dear fellow, you know my methods.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_35	lexical	\N	\N	34	{"text": "\\"You deduced it, then?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_36	lexical	\N	\N	35	{"text": "\\"Certainly.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_37	lexical	\N	\N	36	{"text": "\\"And from what?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_38	lexical	\N	\N	37	{"text": "\\"From your slippers.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_39	lexical	\N	\N	38	{"text": "I glanced down at the new patent leathers which I was wearing.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_40	lexical	\N	\N	39	{"text": "\\"How on earth—\\" I began, but Holmes answered my question before it was asked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_41	lexical	\N	\N	40	{"text": "\\"Your slippers are new,\\" he said.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_42	lexical	\N	\N	41	{"text": "\\"You could not have had them more than a few weeks.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_43	lexical	\N	\N	42	{"text": "The soles which you are at this moment presenting to me are slightly scorched.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_44	lexical	\N	\N	43	{"text": "For a moment I thought they might have got wet and been burned in the drying.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_45	lexical	\N	\N	44	{"text": "But near the instep there is a small circular wafer of paper with the shopman's hieroglyphics upon it.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_46	lexical	\N	\N	45	{"text": "Damp would of course have removed this.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_47	lexical	\N	\N	46	{"text": "You had, then, been sitting with your feet outstretched to the fire, which a man would hardly do even in so wet a June as this if he were in his full health.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_48	lexical	\N	\N	47	{"text": "Like all Holmes's reasoning the thing seemed simplicity itself when it was once explained.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_49	lexical	\N	\N	48	{"text": "He read the thought upon my features, and his smile had a tinge of bitterness.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_51	lexical	\N	\N	50	{"text": "\\"Results without causes are much more impressive.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_52	lexical	\N	\N	51	{"text": "You are ready to come to Birmingham, then?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_53	lexical	\N	\N	52	{"text": "\\"Certainly.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_54	lexical	\N	\N	53	{"text": "What is the case?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_55	lexical	\N	\N	54	{"text": "\\"You shall hear it all in the train.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_56	lexical	\N	\N	55	{"text": "My client is outside in a four-wheeler.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_57	lexical	\N	\N	56	{"text": "Can you come at once?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_58	lexical	\N	\N	57	{"text": "\\"In an instant.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_59	lexical	\N	\N	58	{"text": "I scribbled a note to my neighbour, rushed upstairs to explain the matter to my wife, and joined Holmes upon the door-step.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_60	lexical	\N	\N	59	{"text": "\\"Your neighbour is a doctor,\\" said he, nodding at the brass plate.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_61	lexical	\N	\N	60	{"text": "\\"Yes; he bought a practice as I did.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_62	lexical	\N	\N	61	{"text": "\\"An old-established one?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_63	lexical	\N	\N	62	{"text": "\\"Just the same as mine.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_64	lexical	\N	\N	63	{"text": "Both have been ever since the houses were built.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_65	lexical	\N	\N	64	{"text": "\\"Ah!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_66	lexical	\N	\N	65	{"text": "Then you got hold of the best of the two.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_67	lexical	\N	\N	66	{"text": "\\"I think I did.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_68	lexical	\N	\N	67	{"text": "But how do you know?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_69	lexical	\N	\N	68	{"text": "\\"By the steps, my boy.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_70	lexical	\N	\N	69	{"text": "Yours are worn three inches deeper than his.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_71	lexical	\N	\N	70	{"text": "But this gentleman in the cab is my client, Mr. Hall Pycroft.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_72	lexical	\N	\N	71	{"text": "Allow me to introduce you to him.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_73	lexical	\N	\N	72	{"text": "Whip your horse up, cabby, for we have only just time to catch our train.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_74	lexical	\N	\N	73	{"text": "The man whom I found myself facing was a well-built, fresh-complexioned young fellow, with a frank, honest face and a slight, crisp, yellow moustache.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_75	lexical	\N	\N	74	{"text": "He wore a very shiny top hat and a neat suit of sober black, which made him look what he was—a smart young City man, of the class who have been labeled cockneys, but who give us our crack volunteer regiments, and who turn out more fine athletes and sportsmen than any body of men in these islands.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_76	lexical	\N	\N	75	{"text": "His round, ruddy face was naturally full of cheeriness, but the corners of his mouth seemed to me to be pulled down in a half-comical distress.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_77	lexical	\N	\N	76	{"text": "It was not, however, until we were all in a first-class carriage and well started upon our journey to Birmingham that I was able to learn what the trouble was which had driven him to Sherlock Holmes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_78	lexical	\N	\N	77	{"text": "\\"We have a clear run here of seventy minutes,\\" Holmes remarked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_79	lexical	\N	\N	78	{"text": "\\"I want you, Mr. Hall Pycroft, to tell my friend your very interesting experience exactly as you have told it to me, or with more detail if possible.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_80	lexical	\N	\N	79	{"text": "It will be of use to me to hear the succession of events again.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_81	lexical	\N	\N	80	{"text": "It is a case, Watson, which may prove to have something in it, or may prove to have nothing, but which, at least, presents those unusual and _outré_ features which are as dear to you as they are to me.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_82	lexical	\N	\N	81	{"text": "Now, Mr. Pycroft, I shall not interrupt you again.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_83	lexical	\N	\N	82	{"text": "Our young companion looked at me with a twinkle in his eye.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_84	lexical	\N	\N	83	{"text": "\\"The worst of the story is,\\" said he, \\"that I show myself up as such a confounded fool.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_85	lexical	\N	\N	84	{"text": "Of course it may work out all right, and I don't see that I could have done otherwise; but if I have lost my crib and get nothing in exchange I shall feel what a soft Johnnie I have been.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_86	lexical	\N	\N	85	{"text": "I'm not very good at telling a story, Dr. Watson, but it is like this with me:", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_87	lexical	\N	\N	86	{"text": "\\"I used to have a billet at Coxon & Woodhouse, of Drapers' Gardens, but they were let in early in the spring through the Venezuelan loan, as no doubt you remember, and came a nasty cropper.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_88	lexical	\N	\N	87	{"text": "I had been with them five years, and old Coxon gave me a ripping good testimonial when the smash came, but of course we clerks were all turned adrift, the twenty-seven of us.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_89	lexical	\N	\N	88	{"text": "I tried here and tried there, but there were lots of other chaps on the same lay as myself, and it was a perfect frost for a long time.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_90	lexical	\N	\N	89	{"text": "I had been taking three pounds a week at Coxon's, and I had saved about seventy of them, but I soon worked my way through that and out at the other end.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_91	lexical	\N	\N	90	{"text": "I was fairly at the end of my tether at last, and could hardly find the stamps to answer the advertisements or the envelopes to stick them to.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_92	lexical	\N	\N	91	{"text": "I had worn out my boots paddling up office stairs, and I seemed just as far from getting a billet as ever.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_93	lexical	\N	\N	92	{"text": "\\"At last I saw a vacancy at Mawson & Williams', the great stockbroking firm in Lombard Street.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_94	lexical	\N	\N	93	{"text": "I daresay E.C.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_95	lexical	\N	\N	94	{"text": "is not much in your line, but I can tell you that this is about the richest house in London.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_96	lexical	\N	\N	95	{"text": "The advertisement was to be answered by letter only.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_97	lexical	\N	\N	96	{"text": "I sent in my testimonial and application, but without the least hope of getting it.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_98	lexical	\N	\N	97	{"text": "Back came an answer by return, saying that if I would appear next Monday I might take over my new duties at once, provided that my appearance was satisfactory.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_99	lexical	\N	\N	98	{"text": "No one knows how these things are worked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_100	lexical	\N	\N	99	{"text": "Some people say that the manager just plunges his hand into the heap and takes the first that comes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_101	lexical	\N	\N	100	{"text": "Anyhow it was my innings that time, and I don't ever wish to feel better pleased.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_102	lexical	\N	\N	101	{"text": "The screw was a pound a week rise, and the duties just about the same as at Coxon's.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_103	lexical	\N	\N	102	{"text": "\\"And now I come to the queer part of the business.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_104	lexical	\N	\N	103	{"text": "I was in diggings out Hampstead way—17, Potter's Terrace.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_105	lexical	\N	\N	104	{"text": "Well, I was sitting doing a smoke that very evening after I had been promised the appointment, when up came my landlady with a card which had 'Arthur Pinner, Financial Agent,' printed upon it.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_106	lexical	\N	\N	105	{"text": "I had never heard the name before and could not imagine what he wanted with me; but, of course, I asked her to show him up.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_107	lexical	\N	\N	106	{"text": "In he walked, a middle-sized, dark-haired, dark-eyed, black-bearded man, with a touch of the Sheeny about his nose.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_108	lexical	\N	\N	107	{"text": "He had a brisk kind of way with him and spoke sharply, like a man who knew the value of time.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_109	lexical	\N	\N	108	{"text": "'\\" said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_110	lexical	\N	\N	109	{"text": "Pycroft, I believe?'\\" said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_111	lexical	\N	\N	110	{"text": "\\"'Yes, sir,' I answered, pushing a chair towards him.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_112	lexical	\N	\N	111	{"text": "\\"'Lately engaged at Coxon & Woodhouse's?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_113	lexical	\N	\N	112	{"text": "\\"'Yes, sir.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_114	lexical	\N	\N	113	{"text": "\\"'And now on the staff of Mawson's.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_115	lexical	\N	\N	114	{"text": "\\"'Quite so.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_116	lexical	\N	\N	115	{"text": "\\"'Well,' said he, 'the fact is that I have heard some really extraordinary stories about your financial ability.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_117	lexical	\N	\N	116	{"text": "You remember Parker, who used to be Coxon's manager?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_118	lexical	\N	\N	117	{"text": "He can never say enough about it.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_119	lexical	\N	\N	118	{"text": "\\"Of course I was pleased to hear this.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_120	lexical	\N	\N	119	{"text": "I had always been pretty sharp in the office, but I had never dreamed that I was talked about in the City in this fashion.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_121	lexical	\N	\N	120	{"text": "' said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_122	lexical	\N	\N	121	{"text": "a good memory?' said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_123	lexical	\N	\N	122	{"text": "\\"'Pretty fair,' I answered, modestly.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_124	lexical	\N	\N	123	{"text": "' he asked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_125	lexical	\N	\N	124	{"text": "kept in touch with the market while you have been out of work?' he asked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_126	lexical	\N	\N	125	{"text": "\\"'Yes; I read the Stock Exchange List every morning.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_127	lexical	\N	\N	126	{"text": "' he cried.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_128	lexical	\N	\N	127	{"text": "'That is the way to prosper!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_129	lexical	\N	\N	128	{"text": "You won't mind my testing you, will you?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_130	lexical	\N	\N	129	{"text": "Let me see.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_131	lexical	\N	\N	130	{"text": "testing you, will you? Let me see. How are Ayrshires?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_132	lexical	\N	\N	131	{"text": "\\"'A hundred and six and a quarter to a hundred and five and seven-eighths.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_133	lexical	\N	\N	132	{"text": "\\"'And New Zealand Consolidated?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_134	lexical	\N	\N	133	{"text": "\\"'A hundred and four.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_135	lexical	\N	\N	134	{"text": "\\"'And British Broken Hills?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_136	lexical	\N	\N	135	{"text": "\\"'Seven to seven-and-six.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_137	lexical	\N	\N	136	{"text": "' he cried, with his hands up.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_138	lexical	\N	\N	137	{"text": "'This quite fits in with all that I had heard.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_139	lexical	\N	\N	138	{"text": "I had heard. My boy, my boy, you are very much too good to be a clerk at Mawson's!'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_140	lexical	\N	\N	139	{"text": "\\"This outburst rather astonished me, as you can think.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_141	lexical	\N	\N	140	{"text": "'Well,' said I, 'other people don't think quite so much of me as you seem to do, Mr. Pinner.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_142	lexical	\N	\N	141	{"text": "I had a hard enough fight to get this berth, and I am very glad to have it.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_143	lexical	\N	\N	142	{"text": "\\"'Pooh, man; you should soar above it.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_144	lexical	\N	\N	143	{"text": "You are not in your true sphere.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_145	lexical	\N	\N	144	{"text": "Now, I'll tell you how it stands with me.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_146	lexical	\N	\N	145	{"text": "What I have to offer is little enough when measured by your ability, but when compared with Mawson's, it's light to dark.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_147	lexical	\N	\N	146	{"text": "Let me see.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_148	lexical	\N	\N	147	{"text": "When do you go to Mawson's?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_3", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_149	lexical	\N	\N	148	{"text": "\\"'On Monday.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_150	lexical	\N	\N	149	{"text": "\\"'Ha, ha!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_151	lexical	\N	\N	150	{"text": "I think I would risk a little sporting flutter that you don't go there at all.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_152	lexical	\N	\N	151	{"text": "\\"'Not go to Mawson's?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_153	lexical	\N	\N	152	{"text": "\\"'No, sir.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_154	lexical	\N	\N	153	{"text": "By that day you will be the business manager of the Franco-Midland Hardware Company, Limited, with a hundred and thirty-four branches in the towns and villages of France, not counting one in Brussels and one in San Remo.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_155	lexical	\N	\N	154	{"text": "\\"This took my breath away.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_156	lexical	\N	\N	155	{"text": "'I never heard of it,' said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_157	lexical	\N	\N	156	{"text": "\\"'Very likely not.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_194	lexical	\N	\N	193	{"text": "'I'll write and resign,' said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_158	lexical	\N	\N	157	{"text": "It has been kept very quiet, for the capital was all privately subscribed, and it's too good a thing to let the public into.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_159	lexical	\N	\N	158	{"text": "My brother, Harry Pinner, is promoter, and joins the board after allotment as managing director.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_160	lexical	\N	\N	159	{"text": "He knew I was in the swim down here, and asked me to pick up a good man cheap.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_161	lexical	\N	\N	160	{"text": "A young, pushing man with plenty of snap about him.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_162	lexical	\N	\N	161	{"text": "Parker spoke of you, and that brought me here to-night.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_163	lexical	\N	\N	162	{"text": "We can only offer you a beggarly five hundred to start with.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_164	lexical	\N	\N	163	{"text": "' I shouted.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_165	lexical	\N	\N	164	{"text": "ed a year!' I shouted.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_166	lexical	\N	\N	165	{"text": "\\"'Only that at the beginning; but you are to have an overriding commission of one per cent on all business done by your agents, and you may take my word for it that this will come to more than your salary.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_167	lexical	\N	\N	166	{"text": "\\"'But I know nothing about hardware.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_168	lexical	\N	\N	167	{"text": "\\"'Tut, my boy; you know about figures.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_169	lexical	\N	\N	168	{"text": "\\"My head buzzed, and I could hardly sit still in my chair.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_170	lexical	\N	\N	169	{"text": "But suddenly a little chill of doubt came upon me.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_171	lexical	\N	\N	170	{"text": "\\"'I must be frank with you,' said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_172	lexical	\N	\N	171	{"text": "'Mawson only gives me two hundred, but Mawson is safe.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_173	lexical	\N	\N	172	{"text": "Now, really, I know so little about your company that—'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_174	lexical	\N	\N	173	{"text": "' he cried, in a kind of ecstasy of delight.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_175	lexical	\N	\N	174	{"text": "'You are the very man for us.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_176	lexical	\N	\N	175	{"text": "You are not to be talked over, and quite right, too.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_177	lexical	\N	\N	176	{"text": "d quite right, too. Now, here's a note for a hundred pounds, and if you think that we can do business you may just slip it into your pocket as an advance upon your salary.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_178	lexical	\N	\N	177	{"text": "\\"'That is very handsome,' said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_179	lexical	\N	\N	178	{"text": "'When should I take over my new duties?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_180	lexical	\N	\N	179	{"text": "\\"'Be in Birmingham to-morrow at one,' said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_181	lexical	\N	\N	180	{"text": "'I have a note in my pocket here which you will take to my brother.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_182	lexical	\N	\N	181	{"text": "You will find him at 126B, Corporation Street, where the temporary offices of the company are situated.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_183	lexical	\N	\N	182	{"text": "Of course he must confirm your engagement, but between ourselves it will be all right.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_184	lexical	\N	\N	183	{"text": "\\"'Really, I hardly know how to express my gratitude, Mr. Pinner,' said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_185	lexical	\N	\N	184	{"text": "\\"'Not at all, my boy.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_186	lexical	\N	\N	185	{"text": "You have only got your deserts.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_187	lexical	\N	\N	186	{"text": "There are one or two small things—mere formalities—which I must arrange with you.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_188	lexical	\N	\N	187	{"text": "You have a bit of paper beside you there.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_189	lexical	\N	\N	188	{"text": "Kindly write upon it \\"I am perfectly willing to act as business manager to the Franco-Midland Hardware Company, Limited, at a minimum salary of £500.\\"'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_190	lexical	\N	\N	189	{"text": "\\"I did as he asked, and he put the paper in his pocket.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_191	lexical	\N	\N	190	{"text": "\\"'There is one other detail,' said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_192	lexical	\N	\N	191	{"text": "'What do you intend to do about Mawson's?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_193	lexical	\N	\N	192	{"text": "\\"I had forgotten all about Mawson's in my joy.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
valley-of-fear	sentence_3	lexical	\N	\N	2	{"text": "CONTENTS", "section": "section_1", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_195	lexical	\N	\N	194	{"text": "\\"'Precisely what I don't want you to do.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_196	lexical	\N	\N	195	{"text": "I had a row over you with Mawson's manager.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_197	lexical	\N	\N	196	{"text": "I had gone up to ask him about you, and he was very offensive; accused me of coaxing you away from the service of the firm, and that sort of thing.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_198	lexical	\N	\N	197	{"text": "At last I fairly lost my temper.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_199	lexical	\N	\N	198	{"text": "\\"If you want good men you should pay them a good price,\\" said I.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_200	lexical	\N	\N	199	{"text": "\\"'He would rather have our small price than your big one,' said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_4", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_201	lexical	\N	\N	200	{"text": "\\"'I'll lay you a fiver,' said I, 'that when he has my offer you'll never so much as hear from him again.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_202	lexical	\N	\N	201	{"text": "' said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_203	lexical	\N	\N	202	{"text": "' Those were his very words.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_204	lexical	\N	\N	203	{"text": "the gutter, and he won't leave us so easily.' Those were his very words.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_205	lexical	\N	\N	204	{"text": "' I cried.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_206	lexical	\N	\N	205	{"text": "'I've never so much as seen him in my life.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_207	lexical	\N	\N	206	{"text": "Why should I consider him in any way?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_208	lexical	\N	\N	207	{"text": "consider him in any way? I shall certainly not write if you would rather I didn't.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_209	lexical	\N	\N	208	{"text": "\\"'Good!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_210	lexical	\N	\N	209	{"text": "That's a promise,' said he, rising from his chair.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_211	lexical	\N	\N	210	{"text": "'Well, I'm delighted to have got so good a man for my brother.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_212	lexical	\N	\N	211	{"text": "Here's your advance of a hundred pounds, and here is the letter.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_213	lexical	\N	\N	212	{"text": "Make a note of the address, 126B, Corporation Street, and remember that one o'clock to-morrow is your appointment.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_214	lexical	\N	\N	213	{"text": "Good-night; and may you have all the fortune that you deserve!'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_215	lexical	\N	\N	214	{"text": "\\"That's just about all that passed between us, as near as I can remember.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_216	lexical	\N	\N	215	{"text": "You can imagine, Dr. Watson, how pleased I was at such an extraordinary bit of good fortune.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_217	lexical	\N	\N	216	{"text": "I sat up half the night hugging myself over it, and next day I was off to Birmingham in a train that would take me in plenty time for my appointment.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_218	lexical	\N	\N	217	{"text": "I took my things to a hotel in New Street, and then I made my way to the address which had been given me.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_219	lexical	\N	\N	218	{"text": "\\"It was a quarter of an hour before my time, but I thought that would make no difference.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_220	lexical	\N	\N	219	{"text": "126B, was a passage between two large shops, which led to a winding stone stair, from which there were many flats, let as offices to companies or professional men.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_221	lexical	\N	\N	220	{"text": "The names of the occupants were painted at the bottom on the wall, but there was no such name as the Franco-Midland Hardware Company, Limited.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_222	lexical	\N	\N	221	{"text": "I stood for a few minutes with my heart in my boots, wondering whether the whole thing was an elaborate hoax or not, when up came a man and addressed me.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_223	lexical	\N	\N	222	{"text": "He was very like the chap I had seen the night before, the same figure and voice, but he was clean shaven and his hair was lighter.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_224	lexical	\N	\N	223	{"text": "' he asked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_225	lexical	\N	\N	224	{"text": "r. Hall Pycroft?' he asked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_226	lexical	\N	\N	225	{"text": "\\"'Yes,' said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_227	lexical	\N	\N	226	{"text": "\\"'Oh!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_228	lexical	\N	\N	227	{"text": "I was expecting you, but you are a trifle before your time.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_229	lexical	\N	\N	228	{"text": "I had a note from my brother this morning in which he sang your praises very loudly.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
valley-of-fear	sentence_787	lexical	\N	\N	786	{"text": "So had Mr. Barker.", "section": "section_19", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_230	lexical	\N	\N	229	{"text": "\\"'I was just looking for the offices when you came.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_231	lexical	\N	\N	230	{"text": "\\"'We have not got our name up yet, for we only secured these temporary premises last week.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_232	lexical	\N	\N	231	{"text": "Come up with me, and we will talk the matter over.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_233	lexical	\N	\N	232	{"text": "\\"I followed him to the top of a very lofty stair, and there, right under the slates, were a couple of empty, dusty little rooms, uncarpeted and uncurtained, into which he led me.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_234	lexical	\N	\N	233	{"text": "I had thought of a great office with shining tables and rows of clerks, such as I was used to, and I daresay I stared rather straight at the two deal chairs and one little table, which, with a ledger and a waste paper basket, made up the whole furniture.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_235	lexical	\N	\N	234	{"text": "\\"'Don't be disheartened, Mr. Pycroft,' said my new acquaintance, seeing the length of my face.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_236	lexical	\N	\N	235	{"text": "'Rome was not built in a day, and we have lots of money at our backs, though we don't cut much dash yet in offices.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_237	lexical	\N	\N	236	{"text": "Pray sit down, and let me have your letter.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_238	lexical	\N	\N	237	{"text": "\\"I gave it to him, and he read it over very carefully.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_239	lexical	\N	\N	238	{"text": "\\"'You seem to have made a vast impression upon my brother Arthur,' said he; 'and I know that he is a pretty shrewd judge.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_240	lexical	\N	\N	239	{"text": "He swears by London, you know; and I by Birmingham; but this time I shall follow his advice.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_241	lexical	\N	\N	240	{"text": "Pray consider yourself definitely engaged.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_5", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_242	lexical	\N	\N	241	{"text": "' I asked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_243	lexical	\N	\N	242	{"text": "my duties?' I asked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_244	lexical	\N	\N	243	{"text": "\\"'You will eventually manage the great depôt in Paris, which will pour a flood of English crockery into the shops of a hundred and thirty-four agents in France.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_245	lexical	\N	\N	244	{"text": "The purchase will be completed in a week, and meanwhile you will remain in Birmingham and make yourself useful.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_246	lexical	\N	\N	245	{"text": "\\"'How?'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_247	lexical	\N	\N	246	{"text": "\\"For answer, he took a big red book out of a drawer.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_248	lexical	\N	\N	247	{"text": "\\"'This is a directory of Paris,' said he, 'with the trades after the names of the people.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_249	lexical	\N	\N	248	{"text": "I want you to take it home with you, and to mark off all the hardware sellers, with their addresses.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_250	lexical	\N	\N	249	{"text": "It would be of the greatest use to me to have them.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_251	lexical	\N	\N	250	{"text": "' I suggested.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_252	lexical	\N	\N	251	{"text": "are classified lists?' I suggested.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_253	lexical	\N	\N	252	{"text": "\\"'Not reliable ones.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_254	lexical	\N	\N	253	{"text": "Their system is different from ours.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_255	lexical	\N	\N	254	{"text": "Stick at it, and let me have the lists by Monday, at twelve.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_256	lexical	\N	\N	255	{"text": "Good-day, Mr. Pycroft.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_257	lexical	\N	\N	256	{"text": "If you continue to show zeal and intelligence you will find the company a good master.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_258	lexical	\N	\N	257	{"text": "\\"I went back to the hotel with the big book under my arm, and with very conflicting feelings in my breast.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_259	lexical	\N	\N	258	{"text": "On the one hand, I was definitely engaged and had a hundred pounds in my pocket; on the other, the look of the offices, the absence of name on the wall, and other of the points which would strike a business man had left a bad impression as to the position of my employers.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_260	lexical	\N	\N	259	{"text": "However, come what might, I had my money, so I settled down to my task.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_261	lexical	\N	\N	260	{"text": "All Sunday I was kept hard at work, and yet by Monday I had only got as far as H.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_262	lexical	\N	\N	261	{"text": "I went round to my employer, found him in the same dismantled kind of room, and was told to keep at it until Wednesday, and then come again.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
valley-of-fear	sentence_983	lexical	\N	\N	982	{"text": "“And why no arrest?", "section": "section_23", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_263	lexical	\N	\N	262	{"text": "On Wednesday it was still unfinished, so I hammered away until Friday—that is, yesterday.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_264	lexical	\N	\N	263	{"text": "Then I brought it round to Mr. Harry Pinner.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_265	lexical	\N	\N	264	{"text": "\\"'Thank you very much,' said he; 'I fear that I underrated the difficulty of the task.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_266	lexical	\N	\N	265	{"text": "This list will be of very material assistance to me.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_267	lexical	\N	\N	266	{"text": "\\"'It took some time,' said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_268	lexical	\N	\N	267	{"text": "\\"'And now,' said he, 'I want you to make a list of the furniture shops, for they all sell crockery.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_269	lexical	\N	\N	268	{"text": "\\"'Very good.'", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_270	lexical	\N	\N	269	{"text": "\\"'And you can come up to-morrow evening, at seven, and let me know how you are getting on.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_271	lexical	\N	\N	270	{"text": "Don't overwork yourself.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_272	lexical	\N	\N	271	{"text": "' He laughed as he spoke, and I saw with a thrill that his second tooth upon the left-hand side had been very badly stuffed with gold.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_273	lexical	\N	\N	272	{"text": "thrill that his second tooth upon the left-hand side had been very badly stuffed with gold.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_274	lexical	\N	\N	273	{"text": "Sherlock Holmes rubbed his hands with delight, and I stared with astonishment at our client.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_275	lexical	\N	\N	274	{"text": "\\"You may well look surprised, Dr. Watson; but it is this way,\\" said he: \\"When I was speaking to the other chap in London, at the time that he laughed at my not going to Mawson's, I happened to notice that his tooth was stuffed in this very identical fashion.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_276	lexical	\N	\N	275	{"text": "The glint of the gold in each case caught my eye, you see.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_277	lexical	\N	\N	276	{"text": "When I put that with the voice and figure being the same, and only those things altered which might be changed by a razor or a wig, I could not doubt that it was the same man.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_278	lexical	\N	\N	277	{"text": "Of course you expect two brothers to be alike, but not that they should have the same tooth stuffed in the same way.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_279	lexical	\N	\N	278	{"text": "He bowed me out, and I found myself in the street, hardly knowing whether I was on my head or my heels.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_280	lexical	\N	\N	279	{"text": "Back I went to my hotel, put my head in a basin of cold water, and tried to think it out.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_281	lexical	\N	\N	280	{"text": "Why had he sent me from London to Birmingham?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_282	lexical	\N	\N	281	{"text": "Why had he got there before me?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_283	lexical	\N	\N	282	{"text": "And why had he written a letter from himself to himself?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_284	lexical	\N	\N	283	{"text": "It was altogether too much for me, and I could make no sense of it.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_285	lexical	\N	\N	284	{"text": "And then suddenly it struck me that what was dark to me might be very light to Mr. Sherlock Holmes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_286	lexical	\N	\N	285	{"text": "I had just time to get up to town by the night train to see him this morning, and to bring you both back with me to Birmingham.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_6", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_287	lexical	\N	\N	286	{"text": "There was a pause after the stockbroker's clerk had concluded his surprising experience.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_288	lexical	\N	\N	287	{"text": "Then Sherlock Holmes cocked his eye at me, leaning back on the cushions with a pleased and yet critical face, like a connoisseur who has just taken his first sip of a comet vintage.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_289	lexical	\N	\N	288	{"text": "\\"Rather fine, Watson, is it not?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_290	lexical	\N	\N	289	{"text": "said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_291	lexical	\N	\N	290	{"text": "\\"There are points in it which please me.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_292	lexical	\N	\N	291	{"text": "I think that you will agree with me that an interview with Mr. Arthur Harry Pinner in the temporary offices of the Franco-Midland Hardware Company, Limited, would be a rather interesting experience for both of us.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_293	lexical	\N	\N	292	{"text": "\\"But how can we do it?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_294	lexical	\N	\N	293	{"text": "I asked.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_295	lexical	\N	\N	294	{"text": "\\"Oh, easily enough,\\" said Hall Pycroft, cheerily.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_329	lexical	\N	\N	328	{"text": "\\"Yes, I have no doubt that we shall be able to do something for you.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_296	lexical	\N	\N	295	{"text": "\\"You are two friends of mine who are in want of a billet, and what could be more natural than that I should bring you both round to the managing director?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_297	lexical	\N	\N	296	{"text": "\\"Quite so, of course,\\" said Holmes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_298	lexical	\N	\N	297	{"text": "\\"I should like to have a look at the gentleman, and see if I can make anything of his little game.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_299	lexical	\N	\N	298	{"text": "What qualities have you, my friend, which would make your services so valuable?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_300	lexical	\N	\N	299	{"text": "or is it possible that—\\" He began biting his nails and staring blankly out of the window, and we hardly drew another word from him until we were in New Street.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_301	lexical	\N	\N	300	{"text": "At seven o'clock that evening we were walking, the three of us, down Corporation Street to the company's offices.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_302	lexical	\N	\N	301	{"text": "\\"It is no use our being at all before our time,\\" said our client.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_303	lexical	\N	\N	302	{"text": "\\"He only comes there to see me, apparently, for the place is deserted up to the very hour he names.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_304	lexical	\N	\N	303	{"text": "\\"That is suggestive,\\" remarked Holmes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_305	lexical	\N	\N	304	{"text": "\\"By Jove, I told you so!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_306	lexical	\N	\N	305	{"text": "cried the clerk.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_307	lexical	\N	\N	306	{"text": "\\"That's he walking ahead of us there.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_308	lexical	\N	\N	307	{"text": "He pointed to a smallish, dark, well-dressed man who was bustling along the other side of the road.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_309	lexical	\N	\N	308	{"text": "As we watched him he looked across at a boy who was bawling out the latest edition of the evening paper, and running over among the cabs and busses, he bought one from him.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_310	lexical	\N	\N	309	{"text": "Then, clutching it in his hand, he vanished through a doorway.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_311	lexical	\N	\N	310	{"text": "\\"There he goes!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_312	lexical	\N	\N	311	{"text": "cried Hall Pycroft.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_313	lexical	\N	\N	312	{"text": "\\"These are the company's offices into which he has gone.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_314	lexical	\N	\N	313	{"text": "Come with me, and I'll fix it up as easily as possible.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_315	lexical	\N	\N	314	{"text": "Following his lead, we ascended five stories, until we found ourselves outside a half-opened door, at which our client tapped.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_316	lexical	\N	\N	315	{"text": "A voice within bade us enter, and we entered a bare, unfurnished room such as Hall Pycroft had described.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_317	lexical	\N	\N	316	{"text": "At the single table sat the man whom we had seen in the street, with his evening paper spread out in front of him, and as he looked up at us it seemed to me that I had never looked upon a face which bore such marks of grief, and of something beyond grief—of a horror such as comes to few men in a lifetime.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_318	lexical	\N	\N	317	{"text": "His brow glistened with perspiration, his cheeks were of the dull, dead white of a fish's belly, and his eyes were wild and staring.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_319	lexical	\N	\N	318	{"text": "He looked at his clerk as though he failed to recognise him, and I could see by the astonishment depicted upon our conductor's face that this was by no means the usual appearance of his employer.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_320	lexical	\N	\N	319	{"text": "\\"You look ill, Mr. Pinner!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_321	lexical	\N	\N	320	{"text": "he exclaimed.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_322	lexical	\N	\N	321	{"text": "\\"Yes, I am not very well,\\" answered the other, making obvious efforts to pull himself together, and licking his dry lips before he spoke.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_323	lexical	\N	\N	322	{"text": "\\"Who are these gentlemen whom you have brought with you?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_324	lexical	\N	\N	323	{"text": "\\"One is Mr. Harris, of Bermondsey, and the other is Mr. Price, of this town,\\" said our clerk, glibly.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_325	lexical	\N	\N	324	{"text": "\\"They are friends of mine and gentlemen of experience, but they have been out of a place for some little time, and they hoped that perhaps you might find an opening for them in the company's employment.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_7", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_326	lexical	\N	\N	325	{"text": "\\"Very possibly!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_327	lexical	\N	\N	326	{"text": "Very possibly!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_328	lexical	\N	\N	327	{"text": "cried Mr. Pinner with a ghastly smile.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_330	lexical	\N	\N	329	{"text": "What is your particular line, Mr. Harris?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_331	lexical	\N	\N	330	{"text": "\\"I am an accountant,\\" said Holmes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_332	lexical	\N	\N	331	{"text": "\\"Ah yes, we shall want something of the sort.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_333	lexical	\N	\N	332	{"text": "And you, Mr. Price?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_334	lexical	\N	\N	333	{"text": "\\"A clerk,\\" said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_335	lexical	\N	\N	334	{"text": "\\"I have every hope that the company may accommodate you.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_336	lexical	\N	\N	335	{"text": "I will let you know about it as soon as we come to any conclusion.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_337	lexical	\N	\N	336	{"text": "And now I beg that you will go.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_338	lexical	\N	\N	337	{"text": "For God's sake leave me to myself!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_339	lexical	\N	\N	338	{"text": "These last words were shot out of him, as though the constraint which he was evidently setting upon himself had suddenly and utterly burst asunder.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_340	lexical	\N	\N	339	{"text": "Holmes and I glanced at each other, and Hall Pycroft took a step towards the table.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_341	lexical	\N	\N	340	{"text": "\\"You forget, Mr. Pinner, that I am here by appointment to receive some directions from you,\\" said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_342	lexical	\N	\N	341	{"text": "\\"Certainly, Mr. Pycroft, certainly,\\" the other resumed in a calmer tone.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_343	lexical	\N	\N	342	{"text": "\\"You may wait here a moment; and there is no reason why your friends should not wait with you.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_344	lexical	\N	\N	343	{"text": "I will be entirely at your service in three minutes, if I might trespass upon your patience so far.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_345	lexical	\N	\N	344	{"text": "He rose with a very courteous air, and, bowing to us, he passed out through a door at the farther end of the room, which he closed behind him.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_346	lexical	\N	\N	345	{"text": "\\"What now?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_347	lexical	\N	\N	346	{"text": "whispered Holmes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_348	lexical	\N	\N	347	{"text": "\\"Is he giving us the slip?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_349	lexical	\N	\N	348	{"text": "\\"Impossible,\\" answered Pycroft.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_350	lexical	\N	\N	349	{"text": "\\"Why so?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_351	lexical	\N	\N	350	{"text": "\\"That door leads into an inner room.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_352	lexical	\N	\N	351	{"text": "\\"There is no exit?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_353	lexical	\N	\N	352	{"text": "\\"None.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_354	lexical	\N	\N	353	{"text": "\\"Is it furnished?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_355	lexical	\N	\N	354	{"text": "\\"It was empty yesterday.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_356	lexical	\N	\N	355	{"text": "\\"Then what on earth can he be doing?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_357	lexical	\N	\N	356	{"text": "There is something which I don't understand in this manner.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_358	lexical	\N	\N	357	{"text": "If ever a man was three parts mad with terror, that man's name is Pinner.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_359	lexical	\N	\N	358	{"text": "What can have put the shivers on him?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_360	lexical	\N	\N	359	{"text": "\\"He suspects that we are detectives,\\" I suggested.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_361	lexical	\N	\N	360	{"text": "\\"That's it,\\" cried Pycroft.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_362	lexical	\N	\N	361	{"text": "Holmes shook his head.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_363	lexical	\N	\N	362	{"text": "\\"He did not turn pale.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_364	lexical	\N	\N	363	{"text": "He was pale when we entered the room,\\" said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_365	lexical	\N	\N	364	{"text": "\\"It is just possible that—\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_366	lexical	\N	\N	365	{"text": "His words were interrupted by a sharp rat-tat from the direction of the inner door.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_367	lexical	\N	\N	366	{"text": "\\"What the deuce is he knocking at his own door for?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_368	lexical	\N	\N	367	{"text": "cried the clerk.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_369	lexical	\N	\N	368	{"text": "Again and much louder came the rat-tat-tat.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_370	lexical	\N	\N	369	{"text": "We all gazed expectantly at the closed door.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_371	lexical	\N	\N	370	{"text": "Glancing at Holmes, I saw his face turn rigid, and he leaned forward in intense excitement.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_372	lexical	\N	\N	371	{"text": "Then suddenly came a low guggling, gargling sound, and a brisk drumming upon woodwork.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_373	lexical	\N	\N	372	{"text": "Holmes sprang frantically across the room and pushed at the door.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_374	lexical	\N	\N	373	{"text": "It was fastened on the inner side.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_375	lexical	\N	\N	374	{"text": "Following his example, we threw ourselves upon it with all our weight.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_376	lexical	\N	\N	375	{"text": "One hinge snapped, then the other, and down came the door with a crash.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_377	lexical	\N	\N	376	{"text": "Rushing over it, we found ourselves in the inner room.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_378	lexical	\N	\N	377	{"text": "It was empty.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_379	lexical	\N	\N	378	{"text": "But it was only for a moment that we were at fault.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_380	lexical	\N	\N	379	{"text": "At one corner, the corner nearest the room which we had left, there was a second door.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_381	lexical	\N	\N	380	{"text": "Holmes sprang to it and pulled it open.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_382	lexical	\N	\N	381	{"text": "A coat and waistcoat were lying on the floor, and from a hook behind the door, with his own braces round his neck, was hanging the managing director of the Franco-Midland Hardware Company.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_383	lexical	\N	\N	382	{"text": "His knees were drawn up, his head hung at a dreadful angle to his body, and the clatter of his heels against the door made the noise which had broken in upon our conversation.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_384	lexical	\N	\N	383	{"text": "In an instant I had caught him round the waist, and held him up while Holmes and Pycroft untied the elastic bands which had disappeared between the livid creases of skin.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_385	lexical	\N	\N	384	{"text": "Then we carried him into the other room, where he lay with a clay-coloured face, puffing his purple lips in and out with every breath—a dreadful wreck of all that he had been but five minutes before.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_8", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_386	lexical	\N	\N	385	{"text": "\\"What do you think of him, Watson?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_387	lexical	\N	\N	386	{"text": "asked Holmes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_388	lexical	\N	\N	387	{"text": "I stooped over him and examined him.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_389	lexical	\N	\N	388	{"text": "His pulse was feeble and intermittent, but his breathing grew longer, and there was a little shivering of his eyelids, which showed a thin white slit of ball beneath.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_390	lexical	\N	\N	389	{"text": "\\"It has been touch and go with him,\\" said I, \\"but he'll live now.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_391	lexical	\N	\N	390	{"text": "Just open that window, and hand me the water carafe.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_392	lexical	\N	\N	391	{"text": "I undid his collar, poured the cold water over his face, and raised and sank his arms until he drew a long, natural breath.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_393	lexical	\N	\N	392	{"text": "\\"It's only a question of time now,\\" said I, as I turned away from him.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_394	lexical	\N	\N	393	{"text": "Holmes stood by the table, with his hands deep in his trouser's pockets and his chin upon his breast.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_395	lexical	\N	\N	394	{"text": "\\"I suppose we ought to call the police in now,\\" said he.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_396	lexical	\N	\N	395	{"text": "\\"And yet I confess that I'd like to give them a complete case when they come.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_397	lexical	\N	\N	396	{"text": "\\"It's a blessed mystery to me,\\" cried Pycroft, scratching his head.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_398	lexical	\N	\N	397	{"text": "\\"Whatever they wanted to bring me all the way up here for, and then—\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_399	lexical	\N	\N	398	{"text": "\\"Pooh!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_400	lexical	\N	\N	399	{"text": "All that is clear enough,\\" said Holmes impatiently.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_401	lexical	\N	\N	400	{"text": "\\"It is this last sudden move.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_402	lexical	\N	\N	401	{"text": "\\"You understand the rest, then?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_403	lexical	\N	\N	402	{"text": "\\"I think that it is fairly obvious.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_404	lexical	\N	\N	403	{"text": "What do you say, Watson?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_405	lexical	\N	\N	404	{"text": "I shrugged my shoulders.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_406	lexical	\N	\N	405	{"text": "\\"I must confess that I am out of my depths,\\" said I.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_407	lexical	\N	\N	406	{"text": "\\"Oh, surely if you consider the events at first they can only point to one conclusion.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_408	lexical	\N	\N	407	{"text": "\\"What do you make of them?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_409	lexical	\N	\N	408	{"text": "\\"Well, the whole thing hinges upon two points.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_410	lexical	\N	\N	409	{"text": "The first is the making of Pycroft write a declaration by which he entered the service of this preposterous company.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_411	lexical	\N	\N	410	{"text": "Do you not see how very suggestive that is?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_412	lexical	\N	\N	411	{"text": "\\"I am afraid I miss the point.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_413	lexical	\N	\N	412	{"text": "\\"Well, why did they want him to do it?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_414	lexical	\N	\N	413	{"text": "Not as a business matter, for these arrangements are usually verbal, and there was no earthly business reason why this should be an exception.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_415	lexical	\N	\N	414	{"text": "Don't you see, my young friend, that they were very anxious to obtain a specimen of your handwriting, and had no other way of doing it?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_416	lexical	\N	\N	415	{"text": "\\"And why?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_417	lexical	\N	\N	416	{"text": "\\"Quite so.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_418	lexical	\N	\N	417	{"text": "Why?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_419	lexical	\N	\N	418	{"text": "When we answer that we have made some progress with our little problem.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_420	lexical	\N	\N	419	{"text": "Why?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_421	lexical	\N	\N	420	{"text": "There can be only one adequate reason.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_422	lexical	\N	\N	421	{"text": "Some one wanted to learn to imitate your writing, and had to procure a specimen of it first.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_423	lexical	\N	\N	422	{"text": "And now if we pass on to the second point we find that each throws light upon the other.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_424	lexical	\N	\N	423	{"text": "That point is the request made by Pinner that you should not resign your place, but should leave the manager of this important business in the full expectation that a Mr. Hall Pycroft, whom he had never seen, was about to enter the office upon the Monday morning.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_425	lexical	\N	\N	424	{"text": "\\"My God!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_426	lexical	\N	\N	425	{"text": "cried our client, \\"what a blind beetle I have been!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_427	lexical	\N	\N	426	{"text": "\\"Now you see the point about the handwriting.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_428	lexical	\N	\N	427	{"text": "Suppose that some one turned up in your place who wrote a completely different hand from that in which you had applied for the vacancy, of course the game would have been up.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_429	lexical	\N	\N	428	{"text": "But in the interval the rogue had learned to imitate you, and his position was therefore secure, as I presume that nobody in the office had ever set eyes upon you.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_430	lexical	\N	\N	429	{"text": "\\"Not a soul,\\" groaned Hall Pycroft.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_431	lexical	\N	\N	430	{"text": "\\"Very good.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_432	lexical	\N	\N	431	{"text": "Of course it was of the utmost importance to prevent you from thinking better of it, and also to keep you from coming into contact with any one who might tell you that your double was at work in Mawson's office.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_433	lexical	\N	\N	432	{"text": "Therefore they gave you a handsome advance on your salary, and ran you off to the Midlands, where they gave you enough work to do to prevent your going to London, where you might have burst their little game up.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_434	lexical	\N	\N	433	{"text": "That is all plain enough.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_9", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_435	lexical	\N	\N	434	{"text": "\\"But why should this man pretend to be his own brother?\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_436	lexical	\N	\N	435	{"text": "\\"Well, that is pretty clear also.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_437	lexical	\N	\N	436	{"text": "There are evidently only two of them in it.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_438	lexical	\N	\N	437	{"text": "The other is impersonating you at the office.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
a-case-of-identity	section_27	section	\N	Section 27	26	{"wordCount": 312}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_439	lexical	\N	\N	438	{"text": "This one acted as your engager, and then found that he could not find you an employer without admitting a third person into his plot.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_440	lexical	\N	\N	439	{"text": "That he was most unwilling to do.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_441	lexical	\N	\N	440	{"text": "He changed his appearance as far as he could, and trusted that the likeness, which you could not fail to observe, would be put down to a family resemblance.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_442	lexical	\N	\N	441	{"text": "But for the happy chance of the gold stuffing, your suspicions would probably never have been aroused.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_443	lexical	\N	\N	442	{"text": "Hall Pycroft shook his clinched hands in the air.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_444	lexical	\N	\N	443	{"text": "\\"Good Lord!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_445	lexical	\N	\N	444	{"text": "he cried, \\"while I have been fooled in this way, what has this other Hall Pycroft been doing at Mawson's?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_446	lexical	\N	\N	445	{"text": "What should we do, Mr. Holmes?", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_447	lexical	\N	\N	446	{"text": "Tell me what to do.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_448	lexical	\N	\N	447	{"text": "\\"We must wire to Mawson's.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_449	lexical	\N	\N	448	{"text": "\\"They shut at twelve on Saturdays.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_450	lexical	\N	\N	449	{"text": "\\"Never mind.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_451	lexical	\N	\N	450	{"text": "There may be some door-keeper or attendant—\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_452	lexical	\N	\N	451	{"text": "\\"Ah yes, they keep a permanent guard there on account of the value of the securities that they hold.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_453	lexical	\N	\N	452	{"text": "I remember hearing it talked of in the City.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_454	lexical	\N	\N	453	{"text": "\\"Very good; we shall wire to him, and see if all is well, and if a clerk of your name is working there.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_455	lexical	\N	\N	454	{"text": "That is clear enough; but what is not so clear is why at sight of us one of the rogues should instantly walk out of the room and hang himself.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_456	lexical	\N	\N	455	{"text": "\\"The paper!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_457	lexical	\N	\N	456	{"text": "croaked a voice behind us.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_458	lexical	\N	\N	457	{"text": "The man was sitting up, blanched and ghastly, with returning reason in his eyes, and hands which rubbed nervously at the broad red band which still encircled his throat.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_459	lexical	\N	\N	458	{"text": "\\"The paper!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_460	lexical	\N	\N	459	{"text": "Of course!\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_461	lexical	\N	\N	460	{"text": "yelled Holmes, in a paroxysm of excitement.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_462	lexical	\N	\N	461	{"text": "\\"Idiot that I was!", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_463	lexical	\N	\N	462	{"text": "I thought so much of our visit that the paper never entered my head for an instant.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_464	lexical	\N	\N	463	{"text": "To be sure, the secret must be there.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_465	lexical	\N	\N	464	{"text": "He flattened it out upon the table, and a cry of triumph burst from his lips.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_466	lexical	\N	\N	465	{"text": "\\"Look at this, Watson,\\" he cried.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_467	lexical	\N	\N	466	{"text": "\\"It is a London paper, an early edition of the _Evening Standard_.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_468	lexical	\N	\N	467	{"text": "Here is what we want.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_469	lexical	\N	\N	468	{"text": "Look at the headlines: 'Crime in the City.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_470	lexical	\N	\N	469	{"text": "Murder at Mawson & Williams'.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_471	lexical	\N	\N	470	{"text": "Gigantic Attempted Robbery.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_472	lexical	\N	\N	471	{"text": "' Here, Watson, we are all equally anxious to hear it, so kindly read it aloud to us.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_473	lexical	\N	\N	472	{"text": "ly read it aloud to us.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_474	lexical	\N	\N	473	{"text": "It appeared from its position in the paper to have been the one event of importance in town, and the account of it ran in this way:", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_475	lexical	\N	\N	474	{"text": "\\"A desperate attempt at robbery, culminating in the death of one man and the capture of the criminal, occurred this afternoon in the City.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_476	lexical	\N	\N	475	{"text": "For some time back Mawson & Williams, the famous financial house, have been the guardians of securities which amount in the aggregate to a sum of considerably over a million sterling.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_477	lexical	\N	\N	476	{"text": "So conscious was the manager of the responsibility which devolved upon him in consequence of the great interests at stake that safes of the very latest construction have been employed, and an armed watchman has been left day and night in the building.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_478	lexical	\N	\N	477	{"text": "It appears that last week a new clerk named Hall Pycroft was engaged by the firm.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_479	lexical	\N	\N	478	{"text": "This person appears to have been none other than Beddington, the famous forger and cracksman, who, with his brother, had only recently emerged from a five years' spell of penal servitude.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_480	lexical	\N	\N	479	{"text": "By some means, which are not yet clear, he succeeded in winning, under a false name, this official position in the office, which he utilised in order to obtain moulding of various locks, and a thorough knowledge of the position of the strong room and the safes.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_10", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_481	lexical	\N	\N	480	{"text": "\\"It is customary at Mawson's for the clerks to leave at midday on Saturday.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_482	lexical	\N	\N	481	{"text": "Sergeant Tuson, of the City Police, was somewhat surprised, therefore to see a gentleman with a carpet bag come down the steps at twenty minutes past one.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_483	lexical	\N	\N	482	{"text": "His suspicions being aroused, the sergeant followed the man, and with the aid of Constable Pollock succeeded, after a most desperate resistance, in arresting him.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_484	lexical	\N	\N	483	{"text": "It was at once clear that a daring and gigantic robbery had been committed.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_485	lexical	\N	\N	484	{"text": "Nearly a hundred thousand pounds' worth of American railway bonds, with a large amount of scrip in other mines and companies, was discovered in the bag.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_486	lexical	\N	\N	485	{"text": "On examining the premises the body of the unfortunate watchman was found doubled up and thrust into the largest of the safes, where it would not have been discovered until Monday morning had it not been for the prompt action of Sergeant Tuson.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_487	lexical	\N	\N	486	{"text": "The man's skull had been shattered by a blow from a poker delivered from behind.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_488	lexical	\N	\N	487	{"text": "There could be no doubt that Beddington had obtained entrance by pretending that he had left something behind him, and having murdered the watchman, rapidly rifled the large safe, and then made off with his booty.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_489	lexical	\N	\N	488	{"text": "His brother, who usually works with him, has not appeared in this job as far as can at present be ascertained, although the police are making energetic inquiries as to his whereabouts.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_490	lexical	\N	\N	489	{"text": "\\"Well, we may save the police some little trouble in that direction,\\" said Holmes, glancing at the haggard figure huddled up by the window.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_491	lexical	\N	\N	490	{"text": "\\"Human nature is a strange mixture, Watson.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_492	lexical	\N	\N	491	{"text": "You see that even a villain and murderer can inspire such affection that his brother turns to suicide when he learns that his neck is forfeited.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_493	lexical	\N	\N	492	{"text": "However, we have no choice as to our action.", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	sentence_494	lexical	\N	\N	493	{"text": "The doctor and I will remain on guard, Mr. Pycroft, if you will have the kindness to step out for the police.\\"", "section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_11", "entities": []}
stockbrokers-clerk	watson	entity	character	Dr. Watson	\N	{"description": "The narrator and physician who has recently married and bought a practice in Paddington.", "firstSection": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1"}
stockbrokers-clerk	sherlock_holmes	entity	character	Sherlock Holmes	\N	{"description": "Consulting detective and Watson's friend.", "firstSection": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1"}
stockbrokers-clerk	mrs_watson	entity	character	Mrs. Watson	\N	{"description": "Watson's wife.", "firstSection": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1"}
stockbrokers-clerk	mr_farquhar	entity	character	Old Mr. Farquhar	\N	{"description": "The doctor from whom Watson purchased the Paddington practice.", "firstSection": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_1"}
