stockbrokers-clerk	event_2_15	event	\N	Holmes asks Hall Pycroft to tell his experience	1	{"section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_79", "sentence_80", "sentence_81", "sentence_82"], "communicatesContent": "I want you, Mr. Hall Pycroft, to tell my friend your very interesting experience exactly as you have told it to me, or with more detail if possible. It will be of use to me to hear the succession of events again. It is a case, Watson, which may prove to have something in it, or may prove to have nothing, but which, at least, presents those unusual and outré features which are as dear to you as they are to me. Now, Mr. Pycroft, I shall not interrupt you again."}
stockbrokers-clerk	event_2_16	event	\N	Hall Pycroft begins his account and says he shows himself up as a fool	1	{"section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "speakerId": "hall_pycroft", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_83", "sentence_84", "sentence_85", "sentence_86"], "communicatesContent": "The worst of the story is that I show myself up as such a confounded fool. Of course it may work out all right, and I don't see that I could have done otherwise; but if I have lost my crib and get nothing in exchange I shall feel what a soft Johnnie I have been. I'm not very good at telling a story, Dr. Watson, but it is like this with me:"}
stockbrokers-clerk	event_2_17	event	\N	Hall Pycroft says he had a billet at Coxon & Woodhouse and that the firm collapsed after the Venezuelan loan	1	{"section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "speakerId": "hall_pycroft", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_87"], "communicatesContent": "I used to have a billet at Coxon & Woodhouse, of Drapers' Gardens, but they were let in early in the spring through the Venezuelan loan, as no doubt you remember, and came a nasty cropper."}
stockbrokers-clerk	event_2_18	event	\N	Hall Pycroft says he worked there five years, received a testimonial, and was turned adrift with the other clerks	1	{"section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "speakerId": "hall_pycroft", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_88"], "communicatesContent": "I had been with them five years, and old Coxon gave me a ripping good testimonial when the smash came, but of course we clerks were all turned adrift, the twenty-seven of us."}
stockbrokers-clerk	event_2_19	event	\N	Hall Pycroft says he searched unsuccessfully for work for a long time	1	{"section": "stockbrokers-clerk-section_2", "speakerId": "hall_pycroft", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_89"], "communicatesContent": "I tried here and tried there, but there were lots of other chaps on the same lay as myself, and it was a perfect frost for a long time."}
