gloria-scott	event_4_8	event	\N	Watson receives a telegram from Victor Trevor asking him to return to Donnithorpe	3	{"section": "gloria-scott-section_4", "speakerId": "victor_trevor", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_141"], "communicatesContent": "return to Donnithorpe, and saying that he was in great need of my advice and assistance"}
