crooked-man	event_3_12	event	\N	Mrs. Barclay cries out during the altercation	2	{"section": "crooked-man-section_3", "speakerId": "mrs_barclay", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_123", "sentence_124", "sentence_125", "sentence_126", "sentence_127", "sentence_128", "sentence_129"], "communicatesContent": "What can be done now? What can be done now? Give me back my life. I will never so much as breathe the same air with you again! You coward!"}
