resident-patient	event_1_8	event	\N	Holmes remarks that the visitor is a doctor's general practitioner	0	{"section": "resident-patient-section_1", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_20", "sentence_21", "sentence_22", "sentence_23", "sentence_24"], "communicatesContent": "Hum! A doctor's—general practitioner, I perceive. Not been long in practice, but has had a good deal to do. Come to consult us, I fancy! Lucky we came back!"}
