greek-interpreter	event_11_1	event	\N	Mr. Melas recounts the story to Watson and Holmes	10	{"section": "greek-interpreter-section_11", "speakerId": "mr_melas", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_429", "sentence_434"], "communicatesContent": "It was a simple story which he had to tell, and one which did but confirm our own deductions."}
