final-problem	event_4_6	event	\N	The man says Holmes does not know him	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "professor_moriarty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_113"], "communicatesContent": "You evidently don't know me."}
final-problem	event_4_7	event	\N	Holmes says that he does know the man and invites him to sit	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_114", "sentence_115", "sentence_116"], "communicatesContent": "On the contrary, I think it is fairly evident that I do. Pray take a chair. I can spare you five minutes if you have anything to say."}
final-problem	event_4_8	event	\N	The man says that all he has to say has already crossed Holmes's mind	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "professor_moriarty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_117"], "communicatesContent": "All that I have to say has already crossed your mind."}
final-problem	event_4_9	event	\N	Holmes says that his answer may already have crossed the man's mind	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_118"], "communicatesContent": "Then possibly my answer has crossed yours."}
final-problem	event_4_10	event	\N	The man asks whether Holmes stands fast and Holmes answers affirmatively	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "professor_moriarty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_119", "sentence_120"], "communicatesContent": "You stand fast?"}
final-problem	event_4_11	event	\N	The man reaches into his pocket and draws out a memorandum-book	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_121", "sentence_122"], "communicatesContent": null}
final-problem	event_4_12	event	\N	The man says Holmes crossed his path on several dates and has persecuted him	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "professor_moriarty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_123", "sentence_124", "sentence_125"], "communicatesContent": "You crossed my path on the 4th of January. On the 23rd you incommoded me; by the middle of February I was seriously inconvenienced by you; at the end of March I was absolutely hampered in my plans; and now, at the close of April, I find myself placed in such a position through your continual persecution that I am in positive danger of losing my liberty. The situation is becoming an impossible one."}
final-problem	event_4_13	event	\N	Holmes asks whether the man has any suggestion to make	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "watson", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_126", "sentence_127"], "communicatesContent": "I asked. any suggestion to make?"}
final-problem	event_4_14	event	\N	The man tells Holmes to drop it and says he must withdraw	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "professor_moriarty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_128", "sentence_129", "sentence_132", "sentence_133", "sentence_134", "sentence_135", "sentence_136"], "communicatesContent": "You must drop it, Mr. Holmes. You really must, you know. I am quite sure that a man of your intelligence will see that there can be but one outcome to this affair. It is necessary that you should withdraw. You have worked things in such a fashion that we have only one resource left. It has been an intellectual treat to me to see the way in which you have grappled with this affair, and I say, unaffectedly, that it would be a grief to me to be forced to take any extreme measure. You smile, sir, but I assure you that it really would."}
final-problem	event_4_15	event	\N	Holmes says danger is part of his trade	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_137"], "communicatesContent": "Danger is part of my trade."}
final-problem	event_4_16	event	\N	The man says the situation is not danger but inevitable destruction	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "professor_moriarty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_138", "sentence_139", "sentence_140", "sentence_141"], "communicatesContent": "That is not danger. It is inevitable destruction. You stand in the way not merely of an individual, but of a mighty organization, the full extent of which you, with all your cleverness, have been unable to realize. You must stand clear, Mr. Holmes, or be trodden under foot."}
final-problem	event_4_17	event	\N	Holmes says he is neglecting important business and rises to leave	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_142", "sentence_143"], "communicatesContent": null}
final-problem	event_4_18	event	\N	The man says it is a pity and that Holmes cannot act before Monday	3	{"section": "final-problem-section_4", "speakerId": "professor_moriarty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_144", "sentence_145", "sentence_146", "sentence_147", "sentence_148", "sentence_149", "sentence_150", "sentence_151", "sentence_152", "sentence_153"], "communicatesContent": "Well, well. It seems a pity, but I have done what I could. I know every move of your game. You can do nothing before Monday. It has been a duel between you and me, Mr. Holmes. You hope to place me in the dock. I tell you that I will never stand in the dock. You hope to beat me. I tell you that you will never beat me. If you are clever enough to bring destruction upon me, rest assured that I shall do as much to you."}
final-problem	event_5_1	event	\N	Watson speaks to Professor Moriarty in a singular interview	4	{"section": "final-problem-section_5", "speakerId": "watson", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_154", "sentence_155", "sentence_156", "sentence_157"], "communicatesContent": "You have paid me several compliments, Mr. Moriarty. Let me pay you one in return when I say that if I were assured of the former eventuality I would, in the interests of the public, cheerfully accept the latter."}
final-problem	event_5_2	event	\N	Moriarty replies to Watson and leaves the room	4	{"section": "final-problem-section_5", "speakerId": "professor_moriarty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_156", "sentence_157"], "communicatesContent": "I can promise you the one, but not the other."}
cardboard-box	sentence_281	lexical	\N	\N	280	{"text": "\\"That's all right,\\" said he.", "section": "cardboard-box-section_7", "entities": []}
