final-problem	event_11_8	event	\N	The evidence Holmes accumulated exposes the gang's organization	10	{"section": "final-problem-section_11", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_417"], "communicatesContent": null}
final-problem	event_11_9	event	\N	The dead man's hand weighs upon the gang	10	{"section": "final-problem-section_11", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_417"], "communicatesContent": null}
