cardboard-box	event_12_4	event	\N	The narrator becomes enraged and threatens to kill Fairbairn if he sees him.	11	{"section": "cardboard-box-section_12", "speakerId": "watson", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_447", "sentence_448", "sentence_454"], "communicatesContent": "You can do what you like, but if Fairbairn shows his face here again I'll send you one of his ears for a keepsake."}
