hound-of-the-baskervilles	event_52_1	event	\N	Sir Henry Baskerville and Miss Stapleton halt on the path and stand talking while Watson watches from a hill.	51	{"section": "section_52", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1956", "sentence_1957", "sentence_1958", "sentence_1959"], "communicatesContent": null}
hound-of-the-baskervilles	event_52_2	event	\N	Stapleton moves among the broken ground toward the pair carrying a green butterfly-net.	51	{"section": "section_52", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1957", "sentence_1958", "sentence_1959"], "communicatesContent": null}
