valley-of-fear	event_3_2	event	\N	A speaker asks Mr. Holmes where he got the names	2	{"section": "section_3", "speakerId": "unknown", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_7", "sentence_9"], "communicatesContent": "What's this, Mr. Holmes? Man, it's witchcraft! Where in the name of all that is wonderful did you get those names?"}
