valley-of-fear	event_3_4	event	\N	A speaker asks Watson whether he would be afraid to sleep in the same room with a lunatic	2	{"section": "section_3", "speakerId": "unknown", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_11"], "communicatesContent": "Watson, would you be afraid to sleep in the same room with a lunatic."}
valley-of-fear	event_3_5	event	\N	McMurdo speaks about asking for nothing better	2	{"section": "section_3", "speakerId": "mc_murdo", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_12"], "communicatesContent": "If your heart is as big as your body, and your soul as fine as your face, then I’d ask for nothing better."}
