valley-of-fear	event_25_2	event	\N	Mrs. Allen prepares to go to bed when the bell rings	24	{"section": "section_25", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1064", "sentence_1065", "sentence_1066"], "communicatesContent": null}
