valley-of-fear	event_25_6	event	\N	Mr. Barker intercepts Mrs. Douglas on the stairs	24	{"section": "section_25", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1071", "sentence_1072"], "communicatesContent": null}
valley-of-fear	event_25_7	event	\N	Mr. Barker tells Mrs. Allen to take Mrs. Douglas up and stay with her	24	{"section": "section_25", "speakerId": "cecil_barker", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1073", "sentence_1074", "sentence_1075"], "communicatesContent": "Take her up! Stay with her!"}
valley-of-fear	event_25_8	event	\N	Mrs. Allen takes Mrs. Douglas to the bedroom and tries to soothe her	24	{"section": "section_25", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1076"], "communicatesContent": null}
