valley-of-fear	event_25_13	event	\N	Cecil Barker states his view that the murderer escaped by the window	24	{"section": "section_25", "speakerId": "cecil_barker", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1084", "sentence_1085", "sentence_1086", "sentence_1087", "sentence_1088", "sentence_1089"], "communicatesContent": "The murderer had escaped by the window."}
