valley-of-fear	event_31_6	event	\N	Barker invites Watson to come over and speak to Mrs. Douglas	30	{"section": "section_31", "speakerId": "cecil_james_barker", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1386", "sentence_1387"], "communicatesContent": "We thought that it was probably you, as your friendship with Mr. Sherlock Holmes is so well known. Would you mind coming over and speaking to Mrs. Douglas for one instant?"}
