valley-of-fear	event_32_4	event	\N	Holmes sits eating toast and watches Watson struggle to follow his reasoning	31	{"section": "section_32", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_1432", "sentence_1433"], "communicatesContent": null}
