valley-of-fear	event_80_13	event	\N	Boss McGinty leads McMurdo aside into the inner room	79	{"section": "section_80", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3613"], "communicatesContent": null}
valley-of-fear	event_80_14	event	\N	Boss McGinty offers McMurdo a job and says he will have it in his own hands	79	{"section": "section_80", "speakerId": "mcginty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3614", "sentence_3615"], "communicatesContent": "See here, my lad, I’ve got a job that’s worthy of you at last. You’ll have the doing of it in your own hands."}
valley-of-fear	event_80_15	event	\N	McMurdo answers that he is proud to hear it	79	{"section": "section_80", "speakerId": "mcmurdo", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3616"], "communicatesContent": "Proud I am to hear it."}
valley-of-fear	event_80_16	event	\N	Boss McGinty assigns Manders and Reilly to McMurdo	79	{"section": "section_80", "speakerId": "mcginty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3617", "sentence_3618"], "communicatesContent": "You can take two men with you—Manders and Reilly. They have been warned for service."}
valley-of-fear	event_80_17	event	\N	Boss McGinty says Chester Wilcox must be settled and can be found at the Iron Dike Company	79	{"section": "section_80", "speakerId": "mcginty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3619", "sentence_3623", "sentence_3624", "sentence_3625", "sentence_3626", "sentence_3627", "sentence_3628", "sentence_3629", "sentence_3630", "sentence_3631", "sentence_3632", "sentence_3633"], "communicatesContent": "We’ll never be right in this district until Chester Wilcox has been settled, and you’ll have the thanks of every lodge in the coal fields if you can down him. He’s the chief foreman of the Iron Dike Company. He’s a hard citizen, an old colour sergeant of the war, all scars and grizzle. We’ve had two tries at him; but had no luck, and Jim Carnaway lost his life over it. Now it’s for you to take it over. That’s the house—all alone at the Iron Dike crossroad, same as you see here on the map—without another within earshot. It’s no good by day. He’s armed and shoots quick and straight, with no questions asked. But at night—well, there he is with his wife, three children, and a hired help. You can’t pick or choose. It’s all or none. If you could get a bag of blasting powder at the front door with a slow match to it—"}
valley-of-fear	event_83_2	event	\N	Morris trembles in every limb	82	{"section": "section_83", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3718"], "communicatesContent": null}
valley-of-fear	event_83_3	event	\N	McMurdo pours whisky into a glass and hands it to Morris	82	{"section": "section_83", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3719"], "communicatesContent": null}
valley-of-fear	event_83_4	event	\N	McMurdo says to Morris to let him hear of it	82	{"section": "section_83", "speakerId": "mc_murdo", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3720", "sentence_3721"], "communicatesContent": "That’s the physic for the likes of you. Now let me hear of it."}
valley-of-fear	event_81_1	event	\N	McGinty orders McMurdo to settle the matter by attacking Chester Wilcox's house	80	{"section": "section_81", "speakerId": "bodymaster_mcginty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3634", "sentence_3635", "sentence_3636", "sentence_3637", "sentence_3638", "sentence_3639", "sentence_3640", "sentence_3650", "sentence_3651", "sentence_3652", "sentence_3653", "sentence_3654", "sentence_3655", "sentence_3656", "sentence_3657", "sentence_3658"], "communicatesContent": "What’s the man done? Didn’t I tell you he shot Jim Carnaway? Why did he shoot him? Carnaway was about his house at night, and he shot him. That’s enough for me and you. You’ve got to settle the thing right. There’s these two women and the children. Do they go up too? They have to—else how can we get him? You’ll do it, then? Of course I will do it. When? Well, you had best give me a night or two that I may see the house and make my plans. Then— Very good. I leave it with you. It will be a great day when you bring us the news. It’s just the last stroke that will bring them all to their knees."}
