valley-of-fear	event_81_11	event	\N	Chester Wilcox moves himself and his family to safer quarters with police guarding them	80	{"section": "section_81", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3674"], "communicatesContent": null}
valley-of-fear	event_81_12	event	\N	McMurdo says he will get Chester Wilcox	80	{"section": "section_81", "speakerId": "mc_murdo", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_3676", "sentence_3677"], "communicatesContent": "Leave him to me. He’s my man, and I’ll get him sure if I have to wait a year for him."}
