valley-of-fear	event_92_1	event	\N	Birdy Edwards tells the gang he is a Pinkerton man and explains his infiltration	91	{"section": "section_92", "speakerId": "birdy_edwards", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_4176", "sentence_4180", "sentence_4181", "sentence_4182", "sentence_4183", "sentence_4184", "sentence_4185", "sentence_4186", "sentence_4193", "sentence_4194", "sentence_4195", "sentence_4196", "sentence_4197", "sentence_4198", "sentence_4199", "sentence_4200", "sentence_4201", "sentence_4202", "sentence_4203", "sentence_4204", "sentence_4205", "sentence_4206", "sentence_4207", "sentence_4208", "sentence_4209", "sentence_4210", "sentence_4211", "sentence_4212", "sentence_4213", "sentence_4214", "sentence_4215", "sentence_4216", "sentence_4217", "sentence_4218", "sentence_4219", "sentence_4220", "sentence_4221", "sentence_4222", "sentence_4223", "sentence_4224", "sentence_4225", "sentence_4226", "sentence_4227"], "communicatesContent": "I am Birdy Edwards of Pinkerton’s. I was chosen to break up your gang. I had a hard and dangerous game to play. Only Captain Marvin here and my employers knew that. It’s over to-night, thank God, and I am the winner. Some of you will take no further hand, and there are sixty more besides yourselves that will see a jail this night. I never believed there was such a society as yours. I thought it was paper talk. I went to Chicago and was made one. I stayed to look after it. I never killed a man in Chicago. I never minted a dollar in my life. I pretended to you that the law was after me. I joined your lodge and took my share in your councils. I beat up old man Stanger the night I joined you. I held your hand, Baldwin, when you would have killed him. I could not save Dunn and Menzies. I gave Chester Wilcox warning."}
valley-of-fear	event_92_2	event	\N	McGinty hisses an accusation at Birdy Edwards	91	{"section": "section_92", "speakerId": "mcginty", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_4215", "sentence_4216"], "communicatesContent": "You blasted traitor!"}
valley-of-fear	event_92_3	event	\N	Birdy Edwards responds to McGinty and continues explaining his actions	91	{"section": "section_92", "speakerId": "birdy_edwards", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_4217", "sentence_4218", "sentence_4219", "sentence_4220", "sentence_4221", "sentence_4222", "sentence_4223", "sentence_4224", "sentence_4225", "sentence_4226", "sentence_4227"], "communicatesContent": "You may call me that if it eases your smart. You and your like have been the enemy of God and man in these parts. It took a man to get between you and the poor devils of men and women that you held under your grip. There was just one way of doing it, and I did it. Many a thousand will call me a deliverer. I’ve had three months of it. I had to stay till I had it all, every man and every secret right here in this hand. I had to act and act quickly."}
valley-of-fear	event_93_1	event	\N	Scanlan receives a sealed note for Miss Ettie Shafter	92	{"section": "section_93", "speakerId": "unknown", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_4232"], "communicatesContent": "Take a sealed note to the address of Miss Ettie Shafter."}
