a-case-of-identity	event_6_1	event	\N	Holmes remarks on the woman's short sight and typewriting	5	{"section": "section_6", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_52"], "communicatesContent": "Do you not find that with your short sight it is a little trying to do so much typewriting?"}
a-case-of-identity	event_6_2	event	\N	The woman replies that she now types without looking at the letters	5	{"section": "section_6", "speakerId": "large_woman", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_53"], "communicatesContent": "I did at first, but now I know where the letters are without looking."}
