a-case-of-identity	event_9_3	event	\N	Holmes speaks to Miss Sutherland and Watson and asks about Hosmer Angel	8	{"section": "section_9", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_88", "sentence_89", "sentence_90", "sentence_91"], "communicatesContent": "You have made your position very clear to me. This is my friend, Dr. Watson, be- fore whom you can speak as freely as before myself. Kindly tell us now all about your connection with Mr. Hosmer Angel."}
a-case-of-identity	event_9_4	event	\N	Miss Sutherland flushes and picks nervously at her jacket fringe	8	{"section": "section_9", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_92"], "communicatesContent": null}
a-case-of-identity	event_9_5	event	\N	Miss Sutherland describes first meeting Hosmer Angel at the gasfitters' ball	8	{"section": "section_9", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_93"], "communicatesContent": "I met him first at the gasfitters’ ball."}
a-case-of-identity	event_9_6	event	\N	Miss Sutherland describes receiving ball tickets from father and mother after his death	8	{"section": "section_9", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_94"], "communicatesContent": "They used to send father tickets when he was alive, and then afterwards they remembered us, and sent them to mother."}
a-case-of-identity	event_9_7	event	\N	Mr. Windibank objects to Miss Sutherland going out	8	{"section": "section_9", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_95", "sentence_96"], "communicatesContent": "Mr. Windibank did not wish us to go. He never did wish us to go anywhere."}
a-case-of-identity	event_9_8	event	\N	Mr. Windibank becomes angry when Miss Sutherland wants to join a Sunday-school treat	8	{"section": "section_9", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_97"], "communicatesContent": "He would get quite mad if I wanted so much as to join a Sunday-school treat."}
a-case-of-identity	event_9_9	event	\N	Miss Sutherland insists on going to the ball despite Mr. Windibank's objections	8	{"section": "section_9", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_98"], "communicatesContent": "But this time I was set on going, and I would go; for what right had he to prevent?"}
a-case-of-identity	event_9_10	event	\N	Mr. Windibank says the guests are not fit for Miss Sutherland and her family to know	8	{"section": "section_9", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_99"], "communicatesContent": "He said the folk were not fit for us to know, when all father’s friends were to be there."}
