a-case-of-identity	event_13_1	event	\N	Holmes says the little things are important	12	{"section": "section_13", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_132", "sentence_133"], "communicatesContent": "It was most suggestive. It has long been an axiom of mine that the little things are infinitely the most important."}
