a-case-of-identity	event_17_2	event	\N	Holmes tells Mary Sutherland to let Mr. Hosmer Angel vanish from her memory	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_188"], "communicatesContent": "Above all, try to let Mr. Hosmer Angel vanish from your memory, as he has done from your life."}
