a-case-of-identity	event_17_3	event	\N	Mary Sutherland asks whether she will see Hosmer Angel again	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_189", "sentence_190"], "communicatesContent": "Then you don’t think I’ll see him again?"}
a-case-of-identity	event_17_4	event	\N	Mary Sutherland asks what has happened to Hosmer Angel	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_191"], "communicatesContent": "Then what has happened to him?"}
a-case-of-identity	event_17_5	event	\N	Holmes says he will handle the question and asks for a description and letters	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_192", "sentence_193"], "communicatesContent": "You will leave that question in my hands. I should like an accurate description of him and any letters of his which you can spare."}
a-case-of-identity	event_17_6	event	\N	Mary Sutherland says she advertised for Hosmer Angel in the Chronicle	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_194"], "communicatesContent": "I advertised for him in last Saturday’s Chronicle."}
