a-case-of-identity	event_17_9	event	\N	Mary Sutherland gives her address as 31 Lyon Place, Camberwell	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_198", "sentence_199"], "communicatesContent": "31 Lyon Place, Camberwell."}
a-case-of-identity	event_17_10	event	\N	Holmes says he understands that Mary Sutherland never had Mr. Angel's address and asks about her father's business	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_200", "sentence_201"], "communicatesContent": "Mr. Angel’s address you never had, I understand. Where is your father’s place of business?"}
a-case-of-identity	event_17_11	event	\N	Mary Sutherland states that her father travels for Westhouse & Marbank of Fenchurch Street	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_202"], "communicatesContent": "He travels for Westhouse & Marbank, the great claret importers of Fenchurch Street."}
a-case-of-identity	event_17_12	event	\N	Holmes thanks Mary Sutherland and tells her to leave the papers and keep the incident secret	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_203", "sentence_204", "sentence_205", "sentence_206"], "communicatesContent": "Thank you. You have made your statement very clearly. You will leave the papers here, and remember the advice which I have given you. Let the whole incident be a sealed book, and do not allow it to affect your life."}
a-case-of-identity	event_17_13	event	\N	Mary Sutherland refuses Holmes's advice and declares loyalty to Hosmer Angel	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": "mary_sutherland", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_207", "sentence_208", "sentence_209"], "communicatesContent": "You are very kind, Mr. Holmes, but I cannot do that. I shall be true to Hosmer. He shall find me ready when he comes back."}
a-case-of-identity	event_17_14	event	\N	Mary Sutherland leaves after placing her papers on the table	16	{"section": "section_17", "speakerId": null, "sourceNodes": ["sentence_211"], "communicatesContent": null}
