a-case-of-identity	event_32_3	event	\N	Holmes says the case has not been entirely devoid of interest	31	{"section": "section_32", "speakerId": "sherlock_holmes", "sourceNodes": ["sentence_384"], "communicatesContent": "The case has, in some respects, been not entirely devoid of interest."}
